# rena0-ko-ground-300 — F1-3 fixture
# Same placement and contact pattern as rena0-hit-ground-300, with the dummy launched at
# 8 HP through MatchConfig::startHP[1] (the port's own launch-time injection, scenes.cpp)
# so one recovered 8 HP hit is lethal.
#
# Measured: the contact lands at update 15, the economy registers the KO at update 16
# (MatchEconomy::koAt(1) >= 0), the victim is left at 1 HP rather than 0, and no respawn
# happens on the contact update.
#
# Open question recorded rather than frozen: MatchFrame::koCredits[0] stayed 0 through
# update 100 after this KO. Either the balloon credit is reported on another index, or it
# needs the round's balloon rules configured (this fixture leaves timeLimit/balloonSize at
# their defaults); the fixture therefore does not assert it.
combo 0 0
seed 5489
spawn 0 0 0 0
spawn 1 0 0 300
dummy_start_hp 8
collision open-field
input 0 MELEE
place_at_attack active
expect 15 melee_hit 1
expect 16 dummy_hp 1
expect 16 dummy_ko 1
expect 16 dummy_respawned 0
expect 16 dummy_alive 1
